WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.033 --> 00:00:00.800
Two Congressional

00:00:00.800 --> 00:00:02.802
staffers are now out of the hospital

00:00:03.269 --> 00:00:03.803
at least.

00:00:03.803 --> 00:00:05.672
But this is after a man with a bat,

00:00:05.672 --> 00:00:06.973
a baseball bat, attacked

00:00:06.973 --> 00:00:08.475
Democratic Congressman Gerry Connolly,

00:00:08.475 --> 00:00:10.010
whose office in Virginia

00:00:10.010 --> 00:00:11.644
Connolly says the suspect attacked

00:00:11.644 --> 00:00:12.645
an intern

00:00:12.645 --> 00:00:13.980
who was working the front desk

00:00:13.980 --> 00:00:15.715
and then struck a senior aide in the head

00:00:15.715 --> 00:00:17.217
with his metal bat.

00:00:17.217 --> 00:00:18.985
CNN has obtained surveillance video.

00:00:18.985 --> 00:00:20.854
It appears to show that same suspect

00:00:20.854 --> 00:00:22.455
chasing a woman in his neighborhood

00:00:22.455 --> 00:00:25.325
just minutes before the attack.

00:00:29.863 --> 00:00:31.131
After that incident, police

00:00:31.131 --> 00:00:31.831
say the suspect

00:00:31.831 --> 00:00:33.400
drove to Connolly's office,

00:00:33.400 --> 00:00:35.602
which was about six miles away.

00:00:35.602 --> 00:00:37.470
And the suspect's father tells CNN

00:00:37.470 --> 00:00:39.172
his son has mental health issues.

00:00:39.172 --> 00:00:40.440
Connolly says the suspect

00:00:40.440 --> 00:00:42.542
had previously contacted his office

00:00:42.542 --> 00:00:44.044
to ask him to help with something.

00:00:44.044 --> 00:00:45.211
And he made some, quote,

00:00:45.211 --> 00:00:47.614
bizarre statements to Connolly's staff.

00:00:47.747 --> 00:00:48.481
Let's bring in Washington

00:00:48.481 --> 00:00:49.682
correspondent Sunlen Serfaty.

00:00:49.682 --> 00:00:51.051
This is terrifying

00:00:51.051 --> 00:00:51.618
and it raises

00:00:51.618 --> 00:00:53.887
real questions about security

00:00:53.887 --> 00:00:55.522
at congressional offices.

00:00:55.522 --> 00:00:56.689
Not just on Capitol Hill,

00:00:56.689 --> 00:00:58.691
but those field offices.

00:00:58.691 --> 00:00:59.826
That's absolutely right, Poppy.

00:00:59.826 --> 00:01:01.861
This was such a brazen attack.

00:01:01.861 --> 00:01:02.695
And the notably

00:01:02.695 --> 00:01:03.997
the two staffers that were hit

00:01:03.997 --> 00:01:05.665
with that metal baseball bat

00:01:05.665 --> 00:01:06.933
they have now been released

00:01:06.933 --> 00:01:08.234
from the hospital.

00:01:08.234 --> 00:01:09.602
In an interview with CNN.

00:01:09.602 --> 00:01:10.103
Congressman

00:01:10.103 --> 00:01:11.971
Connolly says it was only the quick

00:01:11.971 --> 00:01:13.173
thinking of his staff

00:01:13.173 --> 00:01:13.807
that prevented

00:01:13.807 --> 00:01:14.607
many more

00:01:14.607 --> 00:01:16.676
from being injured in this incident.

00:01:16.676 --> 00:01:18.078
And he says a suspect entered

00:01:18.078 --> 00:01:20.313
his office filled with an out-of-control

00:01:20.313 --> 00:01:22.248
rage, demanding to see him.

00:01:22.248 --> 00:01:23.049
The congressman said

00:01:23.049 --> 00:01:23.917
that this is a person

00:01:23.917 --> 00:01:25.552
that had contacted his office

00:01:25.552 --> 00:01:26.386
in the past.

00:01:26.386 --> 00:01:28.621
He reached out for help on an issue

00:01:28.621 --> 00:01:30.790
and his staff did sense, he said.

00:01:30.924 --> 00:01:32.625
And talking to him that he was engaged

00:01:32.625 --> 00:01:34.194
in some bizarre statements,

00:01:34.194 --> 00:01:36.362
but he never made any threats

00:01:36.362 --> 00:01:37.564
like this violent attack.

00:01:42.068 --> 00:01:43.770
Terrifying video caught

00:01:43.770 --> 00:01:45.738
on a home security camera.

00:01:45.738 --> 00:01:47.607
Neighbors say it shows the man now

00:01:47.607 --> 00:01:49.242
accused of attacking a Virginia

00:01:49.242 --> 00:01:50.710
congressman's staffers

00:01:50.710 --> 00:01:52.946
allegedly chasing a woman with a bat.

00:01:53.146 --> 00:01:54.547
Minutes earlier.

00:01:54.547 --> 00:01:56.149
I don't think there is a motivation.

00:01:56.149 --> 00:01:57.884
I think we're talking about real

00:01:57.884 --> 00:01:59.152
mental illness.

00:01:59.152 --> 00:02:01.221
Several neighbors heard the commotion.

00:02:01.221 --> 00:02:02.789
Daniel Ashley says it wasn't

00:02:02.789 --> 00:02:03.523
until he heard

00:02:03.523 --> 00:02:05.291
about a possible connection

00:02:05.291 --> 00:02:07.527
to the attack on the congressman's office

00:02:07.527 --> 00:02:08.161
that he started

00:02:08.161 --> 00:02:08.795
looking through

00:02:08.795 --> 00:02:10.597
his security camera footage.

00:02:10.597 --> 00:02:11.397
That was the clip

00:02:11.397 --> 00:02:12.298
that had

00:02:12.332 --> 00:02:14.000
the woman running away

00:02:14.000 --> 00:02:15.602
from the guy with a baseball bat.

00:02:15.602 --> 00:02:17.303
She's screaming and terrified.

00:02:17.303 --> 00:02:18.071
I heard about that

00:02:18.071 --> 00:02:20.039
Gerry Connolly thing on the news,

00:02:20.039 --> 00:02:22.375
but I had no idea that I was so close

00:02:22.609 --> 00:02:23.443
to home.

00:02:23.443 --> 00:02:24.878
Democratic Congressman Gerry

00:02:24.878 --> 00:02:25.645
Connolly says

00:02:25.645 --> 00:02:26.379
Monday morning

00:02:26.379 --> 00:02:27.447
the alleged attacker

00:02:27.447 --> 00:02:29.215
walked into his district office

00:02:29.215 --> 00:02:31.684
in Fairfax in an enraged state.

00:02:32.018 --> 00:02:34.787
Turns out that he had already used that

00:02:34.787 --> 00:02:36.222
bat to, like, destroy

00:02:37.490 --> 00:02:39.092
all the woman's

00:02:39.092 --> 00:02:41.461
windshield of further west.

00:02:42.362 --> 00:02:44.497
So he was on a tear.

00:02:44.497 --> 00:02:46.933
He did arrive here in a vehicle

00:02:46.933 --> 00:02:49.302
and he walked to the office

00:02:49.302 --> 00:02:51.471
and began swinging the bat,

00:02:51.671 --> 00:02:53.439
striking to staff members.

00:02:53.439 --> 00:02:54.974
The congressman telling CNN

00:02:54.974 --> 00:02:56.576
he wasn't there at the time.

00:02:56.576 --> 00:02:59.312
A man had come into our office

00:02:59.879 --> 00:03:03.416
with a metal baseball bat

00:03:04.050 --> 00:03:06.452
and asked for me.

00:03:06.452 --> 00:03:09.122
And when told that I was at an event,

00:03:09.122 --> 00:03:11.858
he proceeded to attack the young intern

00:03:12.592 --> 00:03:14.661
who was at the front desk

00:03:14.661 --> 00:03:16.129
on her first day.

00:03:16.129 --> 00:03:18.998
And then when noise and commotion became

00:03:18.998 --> 00:03:19.699
clear, others

00:03:19.699 --> 00:03:21.434
came running out of their offices.

00:03:21.434 --> 00:03:24.404
And he attacked my outreach director and

00:03:25.038 --> 00:03:26.739
just hit her badly.

00:03:26.739 --> 00:03:29.209
On the back of her head.

00:03:29.475 --> 00:03:30.243
And the suspect's

00:03:30.243 --> 00:03:31.244
father told CNN

00:03:31.244 --> 00:03:32.478
he has tried to get help

00:03:32.478 --> 00:03:33.980
for his son in the past.

00:03:33.980 --> 00:03:36.216
The 49 year old was also known

00:03:36.349 --> 00:03:37.483
to law enforcement.

00:03:37.483 --> 00:03:39.919
He was charged in January of 2022

00:03:40.119 --> 00:03:40.887
with felony

00:03:40.887 --> 00:03:42.755
assault on a law enforcement officer,

00:03:42.755 --> 00:03:44.090
among other charges.

00:03:44.090 --> 00:03:45.058
Now, the district attorney

00:03:45.058 --> 00:03:47.360
at that time declined to prosecute

00:03:47.360 --> 00:03:48.328
for this incident.

00:03:48.328 --> 00:03:49.362
He is facing charges

00:03:49.362 --> 00:03:50.830
for one count of aggravated

00:03:50.830 --> 00:03:52.098
malicious wounding

00:03:52.098 --> 00:03:53.433
and one count of malicious

00:03:53.433 --> 00:03:54.200
wounding Poppy.

00:03:55.301 --> 00:03:56.636
Allan, thank you for the update.

00:03:56.636 --> 00:03:58.905
Hope that those staffers fully recover.

